, "visa": {"nsfw": true}, "discover": {"nsfw": true}, "american_express": {"nsfw": true}}}, "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@sirokomamaru/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 945164, "client_id": 2628365, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31307f3f6e31cf09508ea5a716df1907", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31307f3f6e31cf09508ea5a716df1907, https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fe1b87ee2e7ab11aa707213513c52a5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2395526159be68e44e62c1e71aa0ebb2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e82f868e037c4fa197ea4de49d56531", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e82f868e037c4fa197ea4de49d56531, https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bc934521931a8e619d48ce0eaca448e9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23729726/uploads/origins/76e431ce-aa0e-4242-a215-e1d8d517d8fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f897b91775fc22963b03c0c8f7110e8 3x"}, "body": "白駒先生、はじめまして。いつも新作イラストを楽しみにしております。\n先生の描かれる表情一つ一つや、気怠さに半眼、あくまでどこにでもいそうな感じが大好きで、特に黒髪メガネの皆さんが刺さりすぎて、陰ながら応援しておりました。\nそんな先生に是非、Skebをお願いしたく、ご連絡させていただきました。\n描いていただきたいのは自身のオリジナルキャラクター単体になります。\nもしよろしければ以下お目通し頂けますと幸いです。\n\n●資料リンク\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1B0YW8uzby2Md2JsvWFd5VFNU76d76vYh?usp=drive_link\n\n●設定\n情報：楢坂 槐(ならさか えんじゅ)/男/35歳/175cm\n容姿：黒髪短髪、前髪のみあげている、いつも楽しそう、大口を開け眉を顰めて笑う(ニヒルな笑みというよりは、心底面白くて耐えられず吹き出すような笑い方をします)\n性格：明るい、好奇心旺盛、人懐っこい、楽しいければなんでも好き、倫理観薄い、邪悪、人の不幸はおかしくてたまらない\n職業：闇医者\n\n闇医者をしながら薬や臓器など様々を売買するブローカー(普通にお金稼ぎ)。\n好奇心旺盛で、スリル好き。悪運だけで全てが都合よく回ってる人生。\n自分が楽しければそれで良い。何においてもそれが全て。\nアニメや漫画だと敵か味方かその日の気分で変わるポジの人。\n\n●その他\n基本的には先生にお任せいたしますが、もし困るようであれば下記を参考にしていただければと思います。\n・口元に手を当てつつ、口内が見える感じで邪悪に笑っている。\n・こちらを向いて手を振っている。\n手や顔が少し血で汚れていたりで、どこかやばい人な空気が出ていたら嬉しいです。目は開いてても、閉じてても構いません！服装なども資料は参考程度で先生の描きやすいようにしていただければ幸いです。\n\n以上、ここまで読んでくださりありがとうございました。\nもしご都合悪いようでしたら気兼ねなくキャンセルしてくださいませ。\nまだまだ寒い日が続きますが、ご自愛ください。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1B0YW8uzby2Md2JsvWFd5VFNU76d76vYh?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sirokomamaru/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 945164, "client_id": 680608, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48657e8c00fe17e4cf18f8b532269c1e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48657e8c00fe17e4cf18f8b532269c1e, https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25d29360ff3f7f8a86db5c911f600df8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc553fcec9840d7035e60ddcdf0f4dd4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f073dd536d083093a3072e5c312aefdb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f073dd536d083093a3072e5c312aefdb, https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02efc3019c9e85b1064689448a7493bb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d12e1b6c/uploads/origins/9341b89e-e303-4346-9249-d8d4e27db8c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d4bdae2e5a77346e1c72de5968b8fd5b 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really love your art. I especially enjoy how you draw very tired men.\n\nIf it's okay, could I please request an illustration of my OC Zana'to? \n\nReferences:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/lzSeLbk (black haired character)\nYou can draw him in any style clothes you like, but please use ribbon hairstyle and horn rimmed tortoiseshell glasses.\n\nAbout: 37 year old male. He has naturally curly hair, droopy eyes, and dark eye circles. He is a patient and kind gentleman who has the aura of a salaryman who is tired from working too much overtime.\nTraits: Lion tail, round pupil, fangs.\n\nThank you very much!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sirokomamaru/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 945164, "client_id": 3097042, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6df61963d686749e6c411499b58275d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6df61963d686749e6c411499b58275d6, https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e15a975f722ebdd037365f557f803c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f612682a428cd16b439fef15682dd3f0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=812018da970f983b35b0935ffbe1a6a0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=812018da970f983b35b0935ffbe1a6a0, https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dc030b845b0494cfea61cb383afbfdfc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0a00e676/uploads/origins/b3903339-f994-4331-bd8c-1694c5e6b1cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2670d75cf53c3f96ecf97f66e2e877c2 3x"}, "body": "Hello sirokoma san, I really like your paintings of those attractive brunette boys! I would like to commission you to create a painting of my OC if possible.\n\nRen (29 years old/189cm): \nHe was left with burns on the right side of his face and neck and on the palm of his right hand, he always tied his hair in order to hide the burnt on face and neck.\nHe is a literature teacher teaching in high school. Because of his past misfortune, he has lost the ability to feel most of emotions and barely smiled, treats others with indifference(except his little sister). His eyes look oppressive when he stops talking.\n\nI'd like you to draw him in a formal suit if you can, or you can feel free to choose an existing outfits.\nPlease feel free to draw. If the amount is not enough, please feel free to send an appeal with the correct amount. Or if you feel uncomfortable with the request, just cancel it.\n\nThanks for reading!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-aihhnski7WEKisY9BRhgquMIuSUXb8b", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@sirokomamaru/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fd1826d4/uploads/origins/6da13df2-fc09-467f-9ad8-b1c192372fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=701b20acc32a4da69c9c8ca42970964a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fd1826d4/uploads/origins/6da13df2-fc09-467f-9ad8-b1c192372fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=701b20acc32a4da69c9c8ca42970964a, https://si.imgix.net/fd1826d4/uploads/origins/6da13df2-fc09-467f-9ad8-b1c192372fec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8f25eee0520906ca5b4e240520d26e10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd1826d4/uploads/origins/6da13df2-fc09-467f-9ad8-b1c192372fec